<p>Dear <%= @lead.first_name %>,</p>

<p>
  Thank you for contacting Mezzanine. We have received your enquiry and our team will get back to you shortly.
</p>

<% if @lead.message.present? %>
  <p>For your records, here is a copy of your message:</p>
  <blockquote style="margin: 0; padding: 12px 16px; border-left: 3px solid #6C312E; color: #444;">
    <%= simple_format(@lead.message) %>
  </blockquote>
<% end %>

<p>
  If you have anything further to add in the meantime, simply reply to this email or write to us at
  <%= mail_to "hello@mezzaninecowork.com" %>.
</p>

<p>We look forward to speaking with you.</p>

<p>
  Kind regards,<br>
  The Mezzanine team<br>
  Rua Brito e Cunha, 27 · Matosinhos<br>
  <%= mail_to "hello@mezzaninecowork.com" %>
  follow us on <%= link_to "Instagram", "https://www.instagram.com/mezzaninecowork/" %>
</p>
